ocean is awesome.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_11","text":"BOOM is awesome too.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_12","text":"And—","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_13","text":"If you put them together,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_14","text":"you've got something that's double awesome!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_15","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_15","text":"I get the rationale, but what actually is it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_16","text":"Huh?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_17","text":"Ocean BOOM is Ocean BOOM.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_18","text":"Haven't you seen it before?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_19","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_19","text":"I have no idea what Elegg is saying.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_20","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_20","text":"No, I don't think I have.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_21","text":"No way!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_22","text":"That's too bad.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_23","text":"It's really awesome.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_24","text":"From far off in the ocean, suddenly... BOOM!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_25","text":"There's this massive boom, followed by a huge plume of smoke.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_26","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_26","text":"Seems like a volcano erupted.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_27","text":"Ding ding ding!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_28","text":"The true identity of Ocean BOOM","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_29","text":"is a volcanic eruption!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_30","text":"You really didn't see it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_31","text":"It was visible even from the deck.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_32","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_32","text":"I must have been somewhere else at the time.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_33","text":"Aw,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_34","text":"that's a shame.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_35","text":"I really want to see it again.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_36","text":"To think we were able to witness such an incredible sight!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_37","text":"The ocean is a really nice place.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_38","text":"I'd say I even like it half as much as BOOM.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_39","text":"No, scratch that. One third.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_40","text":"Actually, let's go with one fourth.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_41","text":"But wait... if Ocean BOOM is both combined...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_42","text":"!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_43","text":"That would mean it's even cooler than BOOM itself!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_44","text":"But nothing can be cooler than BOOM.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_45","text":"Let's just conclude that Ocean BOOM is half as cool as BOOM.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg_s","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_46","text":"I hope you get to see it one day for yourself, Mr. Commander.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_47","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_elegg_boomandshock_02_47","text":"I hope so, too.","jump":null}],"chat":true}